            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Why effectively final?** Values are copied; a changing local would diverge",
                "**Lambda vs anonymous class?** `this` is the enclosing instance; lambda uses `invokedynamic`, no extra class",
                "**Bound or unbound?** `System.out` fixed before the call; `String::length` takes the receiver as first arg"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
